# Local development variables (wrangler dev only — never used in production).
# Copy this file to the repo root as `.dev.vars` (gitignored, never committed)
# and fill in a local test value for local admin-route testing.
#
# REAL production secrets must NEVER go here and NEVER be committed —
# set them in production with `npx wrangler secret put ADMIN_KEY`.

ADMIN_KEY=

# Optional: override AUTO_APPROVE_WORKSHOP for local testing.
# "false" enables manual moderation (submit → pending → /api/workshop/review).
# NOTE: .dev.vars OVERRIDES the [vars] value in wrangler.toml.
#AUTO_APPROVE_WORKSHOP=false
